omer et \u00eatre au plus pr\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_ohVjHebH3IQ7kNvwH8Qj2A&_nc_oc=Adr9FXVMh3EEfxGTW6M1L69LQNt6zqbw6hukiy8W6KCWky3ipMBqnoRyU1I0HXFKhh0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSYdq1MA0pF89Ubr7oi-nfCknXB-raZ1TFe41U87d72AQ&oe=6AF1E534"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=CfvvDoWn3_IQ7kNvwGSL1If&_nc_oc=AdrL9uk_y7jVYyn0rf3LUNZy9mlTCOhV9uqWPWJ0CSwd9afnLNYmxzOwxlMz2puj7q4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSSnZ8QjYU9ZmwJ_KjN0zncSiHaWn-xKAX3hmEb7Qxdrg&oe=6AF1E696"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=h-TIDfGWvBEQ7kNvwHmTIRp&_nc_oc=Adroa1o0ynfuG4XwEuWXl1TWhdWitNS23cofH-MkbAt-J5KRkUszYWaxolITbWgaGJg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTDWG-Yp4z2jxqGHcJbjKFnmlQdBVq0K6CXsDAg3BEERA&oe=6AF1FBB7"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://